@startuml CodeUnits-Overview
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
title CodeUnits of OpenIMS

[OpenIMSBackend]
note as OpenIMSBackendNote
  OpenIMSBackend is the backend of OpenIMS.
end note
OpenIMSBackend .. OpenIMSBackendNote

[OpenIMSFrontend]
note as OpenIMSFrontendNote
  OpenIMSFrontend is the frontend of OpenIMS.
end note
OpenIMSFrontend .. OpenIMSFrontendNote

[OpenIMS]
note as OpenIMSNote
  OpenIMS is an open source inventory-management-system.
end note
OpenIMS .. OpenIMSNote

OpenIMSFrontend --> OpenIMSBackend
OpenIMS --> OpenIMSBackend
OpenIMS --> OpenIMSFrontend

@enduml